***The steps to creating a managed workspace***

; Please change <user name> to your echo $USER

1. source /user/virtuoso.mem/ICM/client/icmanage.cshrc
2. gdp login (the password should be empty)
3. cd /user/virtuoso.catdm/USERS/CAT_DM/perfTest/managed
4. gdp build workspace --content /VSM/cadence_perf_20260317064432/rev01/dev --gdp-name cadence_perf_ws_<user name>



For example for user caev7449:

1. source /user/virtuoso.mem/ICM/client/icmanage.cshrc
2. gdp login (the password should be empty)
3. cd /user/virtuoso.catdm/USERS/CAT_DM/perfTest/managed
4. gdp build workspace --content /VSM/cadence_perf_20260317064432/rev01/dev --gdp-name cadence_perf_ws_caev7449
